            0.319
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Solution :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Let h be height of the cylinder, and r the common radius of the cylinder and hemisphere. Then,"
            }
